  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research for action: Water, Behaviour Change &amp; Environmental Sanitation: Sustainable Solutions to Research, Knowledge and Professionalization (WABES)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Equitable access to safe water and sanitation facilities and services is by far not achieved and a stronger push on multiple levels will be necessary over the next decade to reach SDG 6. This includes developing and using innovative technologies, based on applied research, to foster affordable and sustainable solutions for increased access to safe water and adequate sanitation. To this aim, the SDC continues its fruitful collaboration with the Swiss Research Institute Eawag.</narrative>
  </description>
